                        "I cannot let you do that. You are "
                        "not higher than the user in the role "
                        "hierarchy."
                    ),
                )
            elif guild.me.top_role <= user.top_role or user == guild.owner:
                return False, _("I cannot do that due to Discord hierarchy rules.")
